we wil prepare AI project to toknise pdf and search answer using ai
1) python3 -m venv venv

2) source venv\bin\activate (mac)
   venv\Scripts\activate (windows)

3) pip install -r requirements.txt
Ex.
        langchain
            LLM Framework
            Define LLM Flow

        pypdf
            read pdf file

        sentence-transformers
            used to create embeddings

        chromadb
            chromadb used to connect to vectordb

        openai
            used to generate AI output

        python-multipart
            used to upload the pdf files